      "address": "2913 NE 72nd Dr. , Vancouver, WA 98661",
      "description": "24/7 ER and Specialty Care You Can Count On MedVet Vancouver is open 24 hours a day, seven days a week, 365 days a year providing exceptional emergency veterinary care for pets in Vancouver, WA, Clark County, and the area surrounding Portland, OR. Our expert team provides compassionate, comprehensive care for dogs and cats facing an emergency, injury, illness, or chronic condition. From the moment you walk through our door, your pet is our priority and we treat them like our own. We keep you informed every step of the way so you are a part of your pet’s care. We also partner with your family veterinarian as an extension of their practice so your beloved pet has a complete circle of care to give them the best chance for a long, healthy life. If your pet needs emergency care, you can come directly to our hospital. No appointment is ever needed for emergency care, and our skilled team is here every hour of every day.",
